{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_101916_p56_b17", "persona_id": "db:56", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "1. 当客户反复要求具体参数时，必须直接提供数据或承认无法提供并给出替代方案，绝不能重复话术。", "difficulty_rating": 9, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_102358"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_101916_p56_b17", "persona_id": "db:56", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "2. 线下场景中，应主动邀请客户上手体验，用对比测试（如与竞品同跑原神）来弥补参数缺失。", "difficulty_rating": 9, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_102358"}
